OL,3,GNEWSAGlass centre to be fenced off
OL,4,Aafter break-in bids
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity fencing will be installed
OL,7,Faround the closed National Glass Centre
OL,8,F(NGC) after attempts to break into the
OL,9,Fbuilding.
OL,11,FThe venue, in Sunderland, closed at the
OL,12,Fend of July after custodian Sunderland
OL,13,FUniversity said it needed significant
OL,14,Fremedial work at a cost of between #14m
OL,15,Fand #45m.
OL,17,FThe university recently applied to
OL,18,Finstall 2.44 metre -high (8ft) timber
OL,19,Fhoardings around the site for a
OL,20,Fthree-year period to "restrict unlawful
OL,21,Fentry".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
