OL,3,GNEWSAGlass centre to be fenced off
OL,4,Aafter break-in bids
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning agent, on behalf of the
OL,7,Funiversity, said there had been
OL,8,Fattempted break-ins at the site and the
OL,9,Ffencing would help protect it from
OL,10,Fvandalism and prevent potential
OL,11,Finjuries.
